    - target: {fileID: 687157242196972235, guid: cf237a46746266944bf31a81eaac9c52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: enText
      value: Little Nutbrown Hare, who was going to bed, held on tight to Big Nutbrown
        Hare's very long ears. He wanted to be sure that Big Nutbrown Hare was listening.
        "Guess how much I love you," he said.
